  "notes": "Not confirmed to a single block. The height is not recorded on chain as such and Leonidas's announcement on X could not be read. On-chain test (see evidence): block 840,249 is contradicted by the data, 840,269 is consistent with it. Keep height null and show 840,269 only as the likely one if the game must name a block. The DOG airdrop itself began in block 840,647.",
